# Control-channel script for this app's sim row (sim-run.sh::run_test, sim
# rows only): two BACK presses, each once the app says it is ready for one.
# `wait <regex>` blocks until the log matches; every other line goes to the
# simulator's control channel as typed, the verbs `pdb input` takes on hardware.
# The first BACK pops the fragment back stack inside the first Activity
# instance (the default onBackPressed, which must not finish the Activity);
# the second pops the back stack the re-created instance restored.
wait FragmentDemo[]:] ready for back 1
input back
wait FragmentDemo[]:] ready for back 2
input back
